      "created_at": "2017-02-15T15:05:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, up to now, I had entertained the notion that Dawn was like that other 'build a nation for people with powers and screw the normies' villain from that other, lesser-known comics company. Some guy named Erik, I think? Anyway, I had thought Dawn was, in that vein, caring toward her people and well-intentioned, if misguided.</p><p>Turns out she's freakin'&nbsp;<em>evil</em>.</p>",
